 "result": "```python\nimport cadquery as cq\n\nL, W, T = 100.0, 50.0, 6.0\ninset = 8.0\nhole_d = 5.1\n\nplate = cq.Workplane(\"XY\").box(L, W, T, centered=(True, True, False))\n\npts = [\n    (L / 2 - inset, W / 2 - inset),\n    (-(L / 2 - inset), W / 2 - inset),\n    (L / 2 - inset, -(W / 2 - inset)),\n    (-(L / 2 - inset), -(W / 2 - inset)),\n]\n\nplate = (\n    plate.faces(\">Z\").workplane(origin=(0, 0, T))\n    .pushPoints(pts)\n    .hole(hole_d)\n)\n\ncq.exporters.export(plate, \"out.step\")\n```",
